<title>USA: CME hogs and pork bellies fall on USDA meat report.</title>
<headline>CME hogs and pork bellies fall on USDA meat report.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CME hog and pork belly futures tumbled on selling following the release of a USDA meat supply and export forecast which lowered expected pork exports for both 1997 and 1998, floor traders said.</p>
<p>Sell stops added to the break in pork complex trading, traders said.</p>
</text>
